  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BodyPartInfo
  partName: Mouth
  description: 'Terminal (front-facing) mouth with a highly protrusible upper jaw
    that can extend outward. Contains several rows of fine, closely-set teeth. Function:
    Used for feeding tilapia are omnivorous grazers, using their protrusible jaw
    to scrape algae and plant matter off surfaces, and to filter-feed on plankton.'
  titleFontSize: 45
  descriptionFontSize: 25
