  partName: Nostrils (Nares)
  description: 'A single pair of small openings located just above and in front of
    the eyes. Function: Detect chemical cues in the water (smell), helping the fish
    locate food and sense environmental changes. Not used for breathing.'
  titleFontSize: 45
  descriptionFontSize: 26
