  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BodyPartInfo
  partName: Scales
  description: "Large, smooth-edged (cycloid) scales covering the body in overlapping
    rows. Like tree rings, each scale has fine growth rings called circuli, which
    scientists can count to estimate the fish's age \u2014 a technique used in real
    fisheries research. Function: Provide physical protection for the skin underneath
    and reduce drag while swimming."
  titleFontSize: 45
  descriptionFontSize: 25
